    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13154" root="دمن" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَدَمَّنٌ</span></b>  A place <i>in which,</i> or <i>upon which, cattle
have dunged and staled.</i> (K, * TA.) And water
<i>into which the dung of sheep</i> or <i>goats,</i> or <i>of
camels, has fallen.</i> (S.)

